<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Massalin 9-mo net $39.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Massalin 9-mo net $39.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $39.6 million vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are after $19.5 million paid in corporate tax.</p>
<p>Massalin, controlled by Philip Morris Cos Inc, did not provide data for the third quarter, nor comparatives, EPS or revenues.</p>
<p>At September 30, net worth stood at $201 million. The company reported retained earnings of $82.8 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
